Third-party material
--------------------
- crates/core: vendored, unmodified "artcraft-launcher-core" from the ArtCraft Launcher
  (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Licence files are in crates/core.
- ui/icons/*.png: Craft App Suite app icons from the ArtCraft Launcher. Used to identify the
  apps; they are not covered by this project's licence.
- i18n/*.tsv: translations from the ArtCraft Launcher.
- ui/fonts: Inter, Archivo and Geist Mono, subset to woff2, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (third_party/fonts/OFL-*.txt).
- ui/social/*.svg: Simple Icons (CC0 1.0) and Font Awesome Free "linkedin" (CC BY 4.0, Fonticons, Inc.).
  Details in third_party/social-README.md. The logos are trademarks of their owners.

Trademarks
----------
This project is called CraftHub. Its look is modelled on the ArtCraft Launcher, whose brand licence
forbids forks from using the ArtCraft name, logo or wordmark. None of those are used or shipped here;
"ArtCraft" appears only to name the upstream launcher, its release feed and its community links.
